00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:42.160
are going to do all of the usual blaming. So&nbsp;
Republicans will blame Democrats for crazy bills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:49.680
too much spending, blah, blah, blah. Centrist&nbsp;
Democrats will try to blame the progressive wing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:56.480
The progressive wing will say centrist Democrats&nbsp;
trying to make nice with Republicans is what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:04.000
